Title: Look for fonts in FONTS:TrueType on AROS
Repository: libresprite
Base: 89ea7597ed1d779e85c0019555f5b97c7eac22f0
Requires: preceding patches in series
Date: 2026-11-16
Author: aros-libresprite project
Problem: The Unix font folders do not exist on AROS.
Change: Use FONTS:TrueType and FONTS: on AROS.
Scope: AROS
Upstream: candidate
Verification: Built for mainline AROS x86_64 (GCC 10.5, SDK nightly 20261110); LibreSprite starts on nightly 20261113 (pool v1-1, 2026-11-16)
Removal: None planned.
---
diff --git a/src/base/fs_unix.h b/src/base/fs_unix.h
index a7e442c262f3cfdda1c3647d9047c64afb77fe98..a313f08e7d7cde7945ebd76e77dc748e302942cb 100644
--- a/src/base/fs_unix.h
+++ b/src/base/fs_unix.h
@@ -235,6 +235,14 @@ std::vector<std::string> get_font_paths()
     };
 }
 
+#elif defined(__AROS__)
+
+std::vector<std::string> get_font_paths()
+{
+    // TrueType fonts of the system, then the font drawer itself
+    return { "FONTS:TrueType", "FONTS:" };
+}
+
 #elif !__APPLE__
 
 std::vector<std::string> get_font_paths()
